span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Energy</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Severn Mutual</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Insurance</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Orbis Education</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Education</span></span></li></ul></div></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-light transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"light\" aria-labelledby=\"related\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-head\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-head__eyebrow\">Related</p><h2 id=\"related\" class=\"sv-h2\">What usually goes with this</h2></div><ul class=\"reveal-group sv-grid sv-grid--2\"><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><div class=\"sv-card__top\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-building2 lucide-building-2 sv-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 22V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v18Z\"></path><path d=\"M6 12H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2\"></path><path d=\"M18 9h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2\"></path><path d=\"M10 6h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 10h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 14h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 18h4\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"sv-card__name\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/services/erp\">ERP</a></h3></div><p class=\"sv-card__line\">Finance, inventory and procurement modelled on your exceptions, with history reconciled.</p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><div class=\"sv-card__top\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-boxes sv-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2.97 12.92A2 2 0 0 0 2 14.63v3.24a2 2 0 0 0 .97 1.71l3 1.8a2 2 0 0 0 2.06 0L12 19v-5.5l-5-3-4.03 2.42Z\"></path><path d=\"m7 16.5-4.74-2.85\"></path><path d=\"m7 16.5 5-3\"></path><path d=\"M7 16.5v5.17\"></path><path d=\"M12 13.5V19l3.97 2.38a2 2 0 0 0 2.06 0l3-1.8a2 2 0 0 0 .97-1.71v-3.24a2 2 0 0 0-.97-1.71L17 10.5l-5 3Z\"></path><path d=\"m17 16.5-5-3\"></path><path d=\"m17 16.5 4.74-2.85\"></path><path d=\"M17 16.5v5.17\"></path><path d=\"M7.97 4.42A2 2 0 0 0 7 6.13v4.37l5 3 5-3V6.13a2 2 0 0 0-.97-1.71l-3-1.8a2 2 0 0 0-2.06 0l-3 1.8Z\"></path><path d=\"M12 8 7.26 5.15\"></path><path d=\"m12 8 4.74-2.85\"></path><path d=\"M12 13.5V8\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"sv-card__name\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/services/custom-software\">Custom Software</a></h3></div><p class=\"sv-card__line\">Production systems with authorisation, audit and secrets handled properly from the first commit.</p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><div class=\"sv-card__top\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-globe sv-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h20\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"sv-card__name\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/services/web-application-development\">Web Application Development</a></h3></div><p class=\"sv-card__line\">Server-rendered, budget-enforced front ends that work before JavaScript arrives.</p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><div class=\"sv-card__top\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-code2 lucide-file-code-2 sv-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 22h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7l-5-5H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"m5 12-3 3 3 3\"></path><path d=\"m9 18 3-3-3-3\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"sv-card__name\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/services/application-security\">Application Security</a></h3></div><p class=\"sv-card__line\">Secure code review, CI gates and threat models that engineers will actually maintain.</p><p style=\"margin:0\"><span class=\"badge badge--md badge--brand\">Cybersecurity</span></p></div></li></ul><p class=\"sv-note\" style=\"margin-top:var(--s8)\"><a class=\"u-link\" href=\"/services/cybersecurity\">See everything under Cybersecurity</a></p></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-light transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"light\" aria-labelledby=\"engagement\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-head\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-head__eyebrow\">Commercials</p><h2 id=\"engagement\" class=\"sv-h2\">Shape, timeline and scoping</h2></div><dl class=\"sv-defs\"><div class=\"sv-def\"><dt class=\"sv-def__term\">Timeline</dt><dd class=\"sv-def__desc\">5–7 months, pilot team live by week 6.</dd></div><div class=\"sv-def\"><dt class=\"sv-def__term\">Team shape</dt><dd class=\"sv-def__desc\">A delivery lead, a solution architect, two or three engineers, and a revenue operations analyst.</dd></div><div class=\"sv-def\"><dt class=\"sv-def__term\">Engagement</dt><dd class=\"sv-def__desc\">Phased delivery with a pilot-first rollout.</dd></div><div class=\"sv-def\"><dt class=\"sv-def__term\">Scoping</dt><dd class=\"sv-def__desc\">A named engineer replies within one business day. Scoping call within three.<!-- --> <a class=\"u-link\" href=\"/services/engagement-models\">How the four engagement models differ</a>.</dd></div></dl></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-light transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"light\" aria-labelledby=\"faq\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-head\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-head__eyebrow\">Questions</p><h2 id=\"faq\" class=\"sv-h2\">Frequently asked</h2></div><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Why not Salesforce or HubSpot?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"For most companies, use one of them. Build when your sales motion is genuinely unusual, when per-seat licensing at your headcount exceeds a build, or when you have already built so many integrations around a package that you are maintaining both anyway. We will say which case you are in during discovery.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do you get sellers to adopt it?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"By making every field give something back and by never asking them to type what can be captured. Adoption is a design outcome, not a training outcome — if a seller has to enter data purely so a manager can run a report, no amount of training will fix it, and mandating it produces fiction rather than data.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What about data quality in the migration?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Deduplication, normalisation and enrichment with a report of what we could not reconcile. We would rather hand you 12,000 clean accounts and a list of 400 ambiguous ones than 14,000 records you cannot trust.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can managers still get their reports?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, and they get better ones, because the underlying data is current. The difference is that the report is assembled from activity that happens anyway rather than from a weekly update ritual.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does it integrate with the ERP?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes — accounts, contracts, invoices and payment status, so a seller can answer a billing question without leaving the CRM. If you are buying both from us, the integration is designed once rather than bolted on twice.\"}}]}</script><div class=\"\"><div class=\"faq faq__accordion\" data-orientation=\"vertical\"><div data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"faq__item\"><h3 class=\"faq__header\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-state=\"closed\"><button type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"radix-_R_iulinpfiutb_\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" id=\"radix-_R_2ulinpfiutb_\" class=\"faq__trigger\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"><span>Why not Salesforce or HubSpot?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down faq__chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-_R_iulinpfiutb_\" hidden=\"\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_R_2ulinpfiutb_\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"acc-content faq__content\" style=\"--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)\"></div></div><div data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"faq__item\"><h3 class=\"faq__header\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-state=\"closed\"><button type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"radix-_R_kulinpfiutb_\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" id=\"radix-_R_4ulinpfiutb_\" class=\"faq__trigger\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"><span>How do you get sellers to adopt it?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down faq__chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-_R_kulinpfiutb_\" hidden=\"\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_R_4ulinpfiutb_\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"acc-content faq__content\" style=\"--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)\"></div></div><div data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"faq__item\"><h3 class=\"faq__header\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-state=\"closed\"><button type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"radix-_R_mulinpfiutb_\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" id=\"radix-_R_6ulinpfiutb_\" class=\"faq__trigger\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"><span>What about data quality in the migration?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down faq__chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-_R_mulinpfiutb_\" hidden=\"\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_R_6ulinpfiutb_\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"acc-content faq__content\" style=\"--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)\"></div></div><div data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"faq__item\"><h3 class=\"faq__header\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-state=\"closed\"><button type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"radix-_R_oulinpfiutb_\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" id=\"radix-_R_8ulinpfiutb_\" class=\"faq__trigger\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"><span>Can managers still get their reports?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down faq__chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-_R_oulinpfiutb_\" hidden=\"\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_R_8ulinpfiutb_\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"acc-content faq__content\" style=\"--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)\"></div></div><div data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"faq__item\"><h3 class=\"faq__header\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-state=\"closed\"><button type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"radix-_R_qulinpfiutb_\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" id=\"radix-_R_aulinpfiutb_\" class=\"faq__trigger\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"><span>Does it integrate with the ERP?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down faq__chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-_R_qulinpfiutb_\" hidden=\"\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_R_aulinpfiutb_\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"acc-content faq__content\" style=\"--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)\"></div></div></div><dl class=\"faq__nojs\"><div><dt>Why not Salesforce or HubSpot?</dt><dd>For most companies, use one of them. Build when your sales motion is genuinely unusual, when per-seat licensing at your headcount exceeds a build, or when you have already built so many integrations around a package that you are maintaining both anyway. We will say which case you are in during discovery.</dd></div><div><dt>How do you get sellers to adopt it?</dt><dd>By making every field give something back and by never asking them to type what can be captured. Adoption is a design outcome, not a training outcome — if a seller has to enter data purely so a manager can run a report, no amount of training will fix it, and mandating it produces fiction rather than data.</dd></div><div><dt>What about data quality in the migration?</dt><dd>Deduplication, normalisation and enrichment with a report of what we could not reconcile. We would rather hand you 12,000 clean accounts and a list of 400 ambiguous ones than 14,000 records you cannot trust.</dd></div><div><dt>Can managers still get their reports?</dt><dd>Yes, and they get better ones, because the underlying data is current. The difference is that the report is assembled from activity that happens anyway rather than from a weekly update ritual.</dd></div><div><dt>Does it integrate with the ERP?</dt><dd>Yes — accounts, contracts, invoices and payment status, so a seller can answer a billing question without leaving the CRM. If you are buying both from us, the integration is designed once rather than bolted on twice.</dd></div></dl></div></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-light transition-theme u-section grain\" data-theme-section=\"light\" aria-labelledby=\"enquiry-h2\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-rail\"><div class=\"sv-rail__aside\"><p class=\"u-eyebrow\">Get started</p><h2 id=\"enquiry-h2\" class=\"sv-h2\" style=\"margin-top:var(--s3)\">Book a 60-minute scoping call</h2><p class=\"sv-lede\">A technical conversation with the person who would lead the work — not a qualification script, not a discovery deck. You come away with a written scope, the exclusions stated in the body rather than in an appendix, and a day count that we have not padded.</p><p class=\"sv-note\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:-3px;margin-right:var(--s2)\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"></path><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg>A delivery lead, a solution architect, two or three engineers, and a revenue operations analyst.</p></div><div class=\"sv-rail__body\"><form class=\"sv-form\" id=\"enquiry-form\" action=\"\" encType=\"multipart/form-data\" method=\"POST\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"$ACTION_ID_403c44504416ed33d4af4350092b655f174641e336\"/><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"returnTo\" value=\"/services/crm\"/><div id=\"enquiry-incomplete\" class=\"sv-form__error\" role=\"alert\"><p>Some required fields came through empty. They are marked below — fill them in and send again.</p></div><div id=\"enquiry-email\" class=\"sv-form__error\" role=\"alert\"><p>That email address did not look complete. Check it and send again.</p></div><div class=\"sv-field\"><label class=\"sv-label\" for=\"enq-name\">Your name<span class=\"sv-req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label><input id=\"enq-name\" class=\"sv-input\" type=\"text\" required=\"\" autoComplete=\"name\" name=\"name\"/></div><div class=\"sv-field\"><label class=\"sv-label\" for=\"enq-email\">Business email<span class=\"sv-req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label><input id=\"enq-email\" class=\"sv-input\" type=\"email\" required=\"\" autoComplete=\"email\" aria-describedby=\"enq-email-help\" name=\"email\"/><p class=\"sv-help\" id=\"enq-email-help\">We reply from a person, not a no-reply address.</p></div><div class=\"sv-field\"><label class=\"sv-label\" for=\"enq-company\">Company<span class=\"sv-req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label><input id=\"enq-company\" class=\"sv-input\" type=\"text\" required=\"\" autoComplete=\"organization\" name=\"company\"/></div><div class=\"sv-field\"><label class=\"sv-label\" for=\"enq-country\">Country<span class=\"sv-req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label><input id=\"enq-country\" class=\"sv-input\" type=\"text\" required=\"\" autoComplete=\"country-name\" aria-describedby=\"enq-country-help\" name=\"country\"/><p class=\"sv-help\" id=\"enq-country-help\">Relevant for data residency and time zone.</p></div><div class=\"sv-field\"><label class=\"sv-label\" for=\"enq-interest\">What is this about<span class=\"sv-req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label><select id=\"enq-interest\" name=\"interest\" class=\"sv-select\" required=\"\"><option value=\"\" disabled=\"\" selected=\"\">Choose one</option><option value=\"penetration-testing\">Penetration testing</option><option value=\"application-security\">Application security programme</option><option value=\"cloud-security\">Cloud security review</option><option value=\"grc-compliance\">SOC 2 / ISO 27001 / PCI DSS</option><option value=\"managed-detection-response\">Managed detection &amp; response</option><option value=\"red-teaming\">Red team</option><option value=\"vciso\">vCISO</option><option value=\"custom-software\">Custom software build</option><option value=\"web-application-development\">Web application</option><option value=\"platform-engineering\">Platform &amp; DevOps</option><option value=\"business-systems\">ERP / CRM / HRM / LMS</option><option value=\"devsecops\">Secure SDLC — build and test together</option><option value=\"not-sure\">Not sure yet — help me work it out</option></select></div><div class=\"sv-field\"><label class=\"sv-label\" for=\"enq-message\">What are you trying to achieve, and what is the deadline<span class=\"sv-req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label><textarea id=\"enq-message\" name=\"message\" class=\"sv-textarea\" rows=\"5\" required=\"\" aria-describedby=\"enq-message-help\"></textarea><p class=\"sv-help\" id=\"enq-message-help\">Two or three sentences is plenty. The constraint is usually more useful than the requirement.</p></div><div class=\"sv-field sv-field--check\"><input id=\"enq-consent\" type=\"checkbox\" class=\"sv-check\" required=\"\" aria-describedby=\"enq-consent-help\" name=\"consent\"/><span><label class=\"sv-label\" for=\"enq-consent\">I agree to Envenox contacting me about this enquiry.<span class=\"sv-req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label><p class=\"sv-help\" id=\"enq-consent-help\">We keep enquiry details for 24 months from last contact and never share them. See the privacy notice.</p></span></div><p class=\"sv-help\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sv-req\">*</span> <!-- -->Required.</p><div class=\"sv-form__actions\"><button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn--primary btn--lg\"><span>Send an enquiry</span></button><p class=\"sv-form__sla\">A named engineer replies within one business day. Scoping call within three.</p></div></form></div></div></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-light transition-theme u-section-tight\" data-theme-section=\"light\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-cta-band\"><div><h2 class=\"sv-h2\">A pipeline your sales team updates because it helps them, not because it is mandated.</h2><p class=\"sv-lede\">Phased delivery with a pilot-first rollout.</p></div><div class=\"sv-cta-band__actions\"><a class=\"btn btn--primary btn--lg\" href=\"/contact\"><span>Start a conversation</span></a><a class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--lg\" href=\"/case-studies\"><span>See the work</span></a></div></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"foot theme-dark transition-theme grain\" data-theme-section=\"dark\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"foot__top\"><div class=\"foot__brand\"><a class=\"foot__wordmark\" href=\"/\">Envenox</a><p class=\"foot__positioning\">Envenox is a software development firm. We ship production systems — custom software, web applications, ERP and the platforms underneath them — and we keep an offensive security practice on staff that attacks what we build before anyone else gets the chance.</p><a class=\"foot__hotline\" href=\"tel:+442045259100\" data-ir-hotline=\"footer\"><span class=\"foot__hotline-row\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-phone\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13.832 16.568a1 1 0 0 0 1.213-.303l.355-.465A2 2 0 0 1 17 15h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A18 18 0 0 1 2 4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-.8 1.6l-.468.351a1 1 0 0 0-.292 1.233 14 14 0 0 0 6.392 6.384\"></path></svg><span class=\"u-eyebrow\">Incident response — 24/7</span></span><span class=\"foot__hotline-number\">+44 20 4525 9100</span><span class=\"foot__hotline-note\">Answered by a responder, 24/7. Median pickup under 4 minutes.</span></a></div><nav class=\"foot__cols\" aria-label=\"Footer\"><div><h2 class=\"foot__col-heading\">Cybersecurity</h2><ul class=\"foot__list\"><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/penetration-testing\">Penetration Testing</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/application-security\">Application Security</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/cloud-security\">Cloud Security</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/red-teaming\">Red Teaming</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/managed-detection-response\">Managed Detection &amp; Response</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/incident-response\">Incident Response</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/grc-compliance\">GRC &amp; Compliance</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/vciso\">vCISO</a></li></ul></div><div><h2 class=\"foot__col-heading\">Software Development</h2><ul class=\"foot__list\"><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/custom-software\">Custom Software</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/web-application-development\">Web Applications</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/platform-engineering\">Platform &amp; DevOps</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/erp\">ERP</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/crm\">CRM</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/hrm\">HRM</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/lms\">LMS</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/qa-automation\">QA &amp; Test Automation</a></li></ul></div><div><h2 class=\"foot__col-heading\">Company</h2><ul class=\"foot__list\"><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/about\">About</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/about/leadership\">Leadership</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/approach\">The Adversary Loop</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/careers\">Careers</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/newsroom\">Newsroom</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/locations\">Locations</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/partners\">Partners</a></li></ul></div><div><h2 class=\"foot__col-heading\">Proof &amp; Resources</h2><ul class=\"foot__list\"><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/case-studies\">Case Studies</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/sample-report\">Sample Report</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/customers\">Customers</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/certifications\">Certifications</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/trust\">Trust Centre</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/blog\">Insights</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/research\">Research &amp; Labs</a></li></ul></div></nav></div><div class=\"foot__mid\"><div><h2 class=\"foot__col-heading\">Offices</h2><div class=\"foot__offices\"><div><p class=\"foot__office-city\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.625\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>London<!-- -->, <!-- -->United Kingdom</p><address class=\"foot__office-line\">1 Fore Street Avenue, London EC2Y 9DT</address></div><div><p class=\"foot__office-city\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.625\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Dhaka<!-- -->, <!-- -->Bangladesh</p><address class=\"foot__office-line\">Level 7, Bay’s Galleria, Gulshan 1, Dhaka 1212</address></div><div><p class=\"foot__office-city\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.625\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7\"></path><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg>General enquiries</p><p class=\"foot__office-line\"><a class=\"foot__link u-link\" href=\"mailto:hello@envenox.com\">hello@envenox.com</a></p></div><div><p class=\"foot__office-city\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.625\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7\"></path><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg>Security reports</p><p class=\"foot__office-line\"><a class=\"foot__link u-link\" href=\"mailto:security@envenox.com\">security@envenox.com</a></p></div></div></div><div><h2 class=\"foot__col-heading\">Research notes</h2><form class=\"foot__form\" action=\"/api/newsletter\" method=\"post\"><label class=\"foot__form-label\" for=\"footer-newsletter-email\">Email address</label><div class=\"foot__form-row\"><input class=\"foot__input\" id=\"footer-newsletter-email\" type=\"email\" autoComplete=\"email\" required=\"\" aria-describedby=\"footer-newsletter-hint\" name=\"email\"/><button class=\"foot__submit\" type=\"submit\">Subscribe</button></div><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"source\" value=\"footer\"/><p class=\"foot__form-hint\" id=\"footer-newsletter-hint\">Advisories, teardowns and methodology notes. Roughly monthly. No sales sequence, one-click unsubscribe.</p></form></div></div><div class=\"foot__bottom\"><div class=\"foot__legal\"><p class=\"foot__legal-line\">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> <!-- -->Envenox Ltd<!-- -->. Registered in England and Wales. Registered office:<!-- --> <!-- -->1 Fore Street Avenue, London EC2Y 9DT<!-- -->.</p><ul class=\"foot__legal-nav\"><li><a class=\"foot__legal-link\" href=\"/legal/privacy\">Privacy</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__legal-link\" href=\"/legal/cookies\">Cookies</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__legal-link\" href=\"/legal/terms\">Terms</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__legal-link\" href=\"/legal/accessibility\">Accessibility</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__legal-link\" href=\"/legal/vulnerability-disclosure\">Vulnerability disclosure</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__legal-link\" href=\"/sitemap\">Sitemap</a></li></ul></div><ul class=\"foot__social\"><li><a class=\"foot__social-link\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.co