\"dg-schedArt\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-schedArtKey\",\"children\":\"Drops out\"}],\"Nothing the service lists separately\"]}]]}]\n8d:[\"$\",\"li\",\"5\",{\"className\":\"dg-schedRow\",\"data-stage\":\"window\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-schedHead\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"u-mono dg-schedNum\",\"children\":\"05\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-schedName\",\"children\":\"Roll out\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-schedWhen u-mono\",\"children\":\"Weeks 18–24\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-schedStage\",\"children\":\"Inside the engagement window\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-schedArt\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-schedArtKey\",\"children\":\"Drops out\"}],\"Nothing the service lists separately\"]}]]}]\n8e:[\"$\",\"li\",\"6\",{\"className\":\"dg-schedRow\",\"data-stage\":\"standing\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-schedHead\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"u-mono dg-schedNum\",\"children\":\"06\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-schedName\",\"children\":\"Tune\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-schedWhen u-mono\",\"children\":\"Ongoing\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-schedStage\",\"children\":\"Runs throughout — no fixed window\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-schedArt\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-schedArtKey\",\"children\":\"Drops out\"}],\"Nothing the service lists separately\"]}]]}]\n8f:[\"$\",\"figcaption\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-cap\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-legend\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-legendItem\",\"data-stage\":\"before\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-legendMark\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],\"Before the window opens\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-legendItem\",\"data-stage\":\"window\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-legendMark\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],\"Inside the engagement window\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-legendItem\",\"data-stage\":\"after\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-legendMark\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],\"After the report — a commitment, not an upsell\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-legendItem\",\"data-stage\":\"standing\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-legendMark\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],\"Standing work with no fixed window\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"dg-capNote\",\"children\":[\"Every bar is positioned and sized from that phase’s own stated schedule, converted to a single week axis and drawn to one scale. \",\"Nothing is rounded to make the picture tidier, and a phase whose schedule the service does not state — standing work, a quarterly cadence, anything open-ended — is drawn as a dotted row carrying its own words rather than handed a plausible-looking bar it never had.\"]}]]}]\n91:[\"$\",\"article\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"stack__card\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"stack__index\",\"children\":\"01 / 06\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"stack__title\",\"children\":\"Sales process discovery\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"stack__body\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"sv-phaseWhen u-mono\",\"children\":\"Weeks 1–4\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"sv-phaseBody\",\"children\":\"Shadow actual sales calls. The documented process and the practised one always differ, and the practised one is the requirement.\"}]]}]]}]\n92:[\"$\",\"article\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"stack__card\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"stack__index\",\"children\":\"02 / 06\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"stack__title\",\"children\":\"Model\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"stack__body\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"sv-phaseWhen u-mono\",\"children\":\"Weeks 3–6\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"sv-phaseBody\",\"children\":\"Account, contact, opportunity and activity model, plus the stage definitions with exit criteria. Agreed with the sellers who will live in it.\"}]]}]]}]\n93:[\"$\",\"article\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"stack__card\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"stack__index\",\"children\":\"03 / 06\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"stack__title\",\"children\":\"Build\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"stack__body\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"sv-phaseWhen u-mono\",\"children\":\"Weeks 5–18\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"sv-phaseBody\",\"children\":\"Core pipeline first, in the hands of a pilot team within six weeks. Feedback from real use beats any amount of workshop.\"}]]}]]}]\n94:[\"$\",\"article\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"stack__card\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"stack__index\",\"children\":\"04 / 06\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"stack__title\",\"children\":\"Migrate\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"stack__body\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"sv-phaseWhen u-mono\",\"children\":\"Weeks 14–20\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"sv-phaseBody\",\"children\":\"Deduplicate and migrate accounts, contacts and history. Historical opportunity data gets mapped to the new stage model with the mapping documented.\"}]]}]]}]\n95:[\"$\",\"article\",\"5\",{\"className\":\"stack__card\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"stack__index\",\"children\":\"05 / 06\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"stack__title\",\"children\":\"Roll out\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"stack__body\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"sv-phaseWhen u-mono\",\"children\":\"Weeks 18–24\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"sv-phaseBody\",\"children\":\"Team by team, with training by role and a two-week adoption watch per team. Adoption is measured, not assumed.\"}]]}]]}]\n96:[\"